# The production image needs only CMakeLists.txt, src/, tests/, js/, css/,
# public/ and migrations/. Keeping everything else out also keeps `az acr build`
# uploads small. public/js and public/css hold bundles built locally; the image
# builds its own from js/ and css/.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!src/
!tests/
!js/
!css/
!public/
!migrations/
public/js/
public/css/
